    <h2 style="color:#166534; font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:1.2em;">The Book That Launched the Sabbath Movement</h2>
    <p style="font-size:1.1rem; color:#134e2f;">This is the foundational work that launched the Sabbath movement and the sealing of the 144,000. Joseph Bates, a sea captain turned Adventist pioneer, explains the Sabbath as the sign of God's covenant and the Bride's loyalty. This book is essential for understanding the Most Holy Place message and the final sealing.</p>
