      <h3 style="color:#166534; font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:700;">About Joseph Bates</h3>
      <p style="font-size:1rem; color:#134e2f;">Joseph Bates (1792–1872) was a co-founder of the <b>original Seventh-day Adventist pioneer movement</b>—not the April 15, 1904 state-church. His writings and leadership helped establish the Sabbath as a central pillar of Adventist faith and identity.<br>
      <a href="/april-15-1904-new-organization" style="color:#0e7490; text-decoration:underline; font-weight:600;">Learn about the 1904 new organization &rarr;</a></p>
