      <ul style="font-size:1rem; color:#134e2f; margin-left:1.5em;">
        <li>1846: Publishes <i>The Seventh Day Sabbath, A Perpetual Sign</i></li>
        <li>1847: Influences James and Ellen White to keep the Sabbath</li>
        <li>1863: Helps organize the Seventh-day Adventist Church</li>
        <li>1872: Dies in faith, awaiting the resurrection</li>
