      <p style="font-size:1.08rem; color:#134e2f; max-width:700px;">This companion volume shows that those who keep the Sabbath, obey the truth, and keep the commandments of God and the faith of Jesus (see <b>John 15:7,10</b>), are empowered to perform miracles by claiming the promises of God. True Sabbath-keeping is the sign of faith and obedience that unlocks the miraculous power of Christ for the final generation.</p>
